OL,5,G1100 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,7,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,8,     Ffor the last time. Amid
OL,9,     Faccusations and flaring tempers,
OL,10,     Fthe payments are revealed and the
OL,11,     Fwinner is announced.
OL,12,G1135 A Place in the Sun
OL,13,     FJo and Graham look for their dream
OL,14,     Fholiday home in Mar Menor,
OL,15,     FEurope's largest coastal lagoon,
OL,16,     Fon Spain's Costa Blanca. Jasmine
OL,17,     FHarman shows them five impressive
OL,18,     Fproperties for their #70k.
