OL,5,G1755 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAlistair and Emma host at their
OL,7,     Ffour-star Castle Hill Guesthouse
OL,8,     Fin sleepy Lynton, north Devon. The
OL,9,     Fgroup activity requires a head for
OL,10,     Fheights, and Mrs Tee proves hard
OL,11,     Fto please.
OL,12,G1825 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe competition heads north to the
OL,14,     Fthree-star Vidella in Blackpool,
OL,15,     Frun by fun-loving pranksters John
OL,16,     Fand Neil, who have hatched a plan
OL,17,     Fto pay back Alistair for hating
OL,18,     Ftheir home town.
